    "chunk_text": "De purificatione sancta Maria. Men \u00fea leofestan, s\u00e6ge\u00f0 us & mynga\u00fe \u00feis halige godspel be \u00feysse arwyr\u00f0an tide \u00fee we nu tod\u00e6ge Gode \u00fe\u00e6t is se feowertiga d\u00e6g nu tod\u00e6g ures dryhtnes h\u00e6lendes Cristes acennesse, & \u00fey d\u00e6ge \u00fe\u00e6t his aldoras & \u00fea cwomon dryhtnes aldoras to \u00f0am Godes temple & hie \u00f0\u00e6r Gode \u00e6lmihtigum as\u00e6gdnesse brohton, \u00d0\u00e6r w\u00e6s \u00fea sum eald man in Hierusalem in \u00fe\u00e6re byrig in \u00fea ilcan tid se w\u00e6s haten Simeon. He w\u00e6s so\u00f0f\u00e6st & rihtwis, & he bead \u00fe\u00e6re frefre \u00fe\u00e6re \u00fee he wiste \u00fe\u00e6t he his folce gehaten h\u00e6fde. & se halga gast w\u00e6s mid \u00feone Simeon. & he \u00fe\u00e6re andsware onfeng fram \u00feam halgan gaste, & he him cydde & s\u00e6gde \u00fe\u00e6t he ne moste dea\u00f0es He \u00f0a cwom \u00feurh haliges gastes gife in \u00fe\u00e6t Godes templ on \u00fea ilcan tid \u00fee Cristes aldoras hine \u00feyder & \u00fea genam se halga Simeon \u00feone h\u00e6lend on his earmas, & he hine mid bam handum beclypte, & he Us is nu to witane, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00fe\u00e6t for \u00fean Cristes aldoras \u00fey feowertigan d\u00e6ge hine brohton to \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s in \u00fe\u00e6re Godes \u00e6 \u00fe\u00e6t swa hwylc wif swa bearn cende, \u00fe\u00e6t heo ne moste in \u00fe\u00e6t Godes templ & \u00feonne \u00fey feowertigan d\u00e6ge w\u00e6re, heo \u00feonne sceolde \u00fe\u00e6t bearn gebringan to \u00feam Godes temple. For \u00fean \u00fee ealle wif \u00fee tymende syndon hie send",
